{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"菩提行經卷第四","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"聖龍樹菩薩集頌","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"宋西天中印度惹爛馱囉國三藏明教大師天息災奉詔譯","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]菩提心般若波羅蜜多品第七","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]如來智慧仁　爲一切世閒　令求遠離苦　是故智慧生。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]真如及世間　今說此二法　知佛真如故　說法而智慧。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]彼世閒凡夫　見二種相應　害及勝害等　乃世相應事.","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]彼二事見已　見之乃爲智.","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"智見世閒性　是喻於真如　此說無去來　智者無不見。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]色等甚分明　乃世相應事　不淨而爲淨　智者喻有利.","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"爲知世閒故　是說世閒性　爲見於真如　見以刹那住.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"世閒行相應　此行無過失　如女人不淨　異世諸害事.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本智度品第九.","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]科段.丙五明諸行最勝修智度.又二.今丁初明佛教斷苦故生智.二本頌初二句意雲.上所述一切.佛爲智慧說.","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]丁後明生智慧方便.又二.今戊初辨所知二諦.二本此頌意雲.世俗及勝義.說名爲二諦.勝義非覺境.覺但行世俗.","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]戊後辨能知智慧.又三.今己初辨凡夫瑜伽師所見不同.而瑜伽師亦後後勝前.二本初頌意雲.行二諦者.見有二種.凡夫行者.後勝於前.","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]二本此半頌意雲.瑜伽行者勝解異.後後轉勝於前前.","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]己次釋一切法無自性應不成如幻難.又三.今庚初總解經部等如幻不成難.","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"謂佛福虛幻　使我雲何信　有情苦幻境　雲何復生滅.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼因集和合　乃得於幻緣　有情種子生　雲何有真實.","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"殺彼虛幻人　無心性等罪　平等心虛幻　罪福得生起.","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"真言力等持　幻境心無著　以彼種種幻　種種因業生.","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"何有於一[一]人　得於一切力　[二]若住於真如　或住於淨戒.","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是卽佛行　誰雲菩提行　因緣當斷盡　幻化不可得.","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因緣若斷盡　無生而自得.　[三]若不住疑妄　幻境而不立.","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"幻境若彼無　一切不可得.　[四]如是卽真如　得現於心體.","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"心如是若分　虛幻何由見　心不自見心　世尊之所說.","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如劍刃雖利　雖利不自斷.　[五]自性由若斯　復喻如燈光.","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"破闇然得名　而不雲自照.　[六]又若水精珠　體本唯清[七]澈.","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因青而有青　影現隨衆色　非青而現青　如心而自作.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]據二本當作因.","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]二本此半頌意雲.應勝義涅槃.於世俗流轉.謂一事兩異也.此爲難辭.下文解答.","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]庚次別解瑜伽宗勝義無心應緣幻不成難.二本此半頌意雲.若無錯亂識.由何緣如幻.此難辭.下解答.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]瑜伽宗再難.心外有行相.亦自心所現.下答依自證門廣破.","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]瑜伽宗救.","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]瑜伽宗再救.","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[七]梵本次多一頌.意雲.青則我知爲青.非青亦知非青.謂相决定也.","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]又如彼燈光　智者知此說　智慧此開通　知者何所說.","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]雖開而不開　如人無所覩　石女義不生　與此義不二.","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]亦同無心識　緣念無所得　非念而別生　虛妄念如毒.","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]謂若因若果　爲法而自說.　有談眼藥方　見瓶而無藥.","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若見聞覺知　此有而非有　念斷於苦因　此實念當念.","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"念念而無別　此心當平等　前塵常惑人　了之無所有.","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如幻而不實　妄心而自見.　[五]住塵處輪迴　喻空無所依.","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"住塵性亦然　亦無有所得　若與不善俱　不善汝所得.","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]若心有取捨　施一切如來　如是用心意　而有何功德。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[七]幻境一切知　煩惱雲何斷　於彼幻三毒　遠離而不作。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[八]知於煩惱心　彼作而未盡　於彼得見時　空有意無力.","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"煩惱性非盡　與空而相雜　至彼無所[九]學　彼後乃得盡.","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]瑜伽宗再救.意雲.如燈以照見爲明.心亦以自證爲知.","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]此文再破.意雲.真諦中無見.何有明不明.","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]瑜伽宗再難.無自證則念不成.下答.如中鼠毒.聞雷而病.異受異念亦成.","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]瑜伽宗又難.遠見他心.近應自證.下答.如眼塗藥.不能自見.","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]庚三別解瑜伽宗勝義無有情應流轉不成難.","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]此頌答破.二本意雲.若心離二取.應一切衆生.皆已是如來.說唯心何用.","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[七]己三解一切法無自性應證如幻不成正道難.又五.今庚初敘難.二本此頌意雲.但知如幻.雲何斷惑.如交幻女.亦有貪欲.","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[八]庚次答不證空不得解脫.","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[九]據二本當作得.","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼性而無得　亦復不能見　彼性若無住　雲何住此[一]身.","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若性而無有　身住於無性　是性如去來　隨現而無著.","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]劫樹與摩尼　能如意圓滿　佛變化亦然　當爲斯行願.","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"喻[三]法呪林樹　呪成而枯壞　毒等雖久害　彼彼皆消除.","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"菩薩之修行　所作諸事業　菩提行最勝　佛樹能成就.","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以彼平等行　而住於寂靜　及作不思議　供養得何果.","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"隨彼所行因　而得於彼果　供養等真實　得果而稱實。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]雲何得法空　實得解脫法.　[五]不離牟尼道　當得於菩提.","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"汝不求大乘　何法求圓滿　二乘得成就　成就非圓滿.","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若彼所作因　怖畏於大乘　別怖怖非實　此怖實名怖.","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"此法要當知　大乘之所論　離此爲他法　知彼外道論.","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]法乃僧根本　僧知法出離　心若有著處　涅槃不可得.","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本作心.","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]庚三明證空乃得解脫.文初解無所得亦自然起利他用供養亦可得福.","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]據二本當作鳥.謂金翅鳥咒成塔柱.鳥死仍有消毒之用.","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]庚四明不證空不得見諦.初設小乘人難.意雲.見諦乃解脫.見空復何爲.","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]此文總答意雲.經說無智道.則無菩提故.道卽證空之智.此引大乘教證.故下文旁辨大乘是佛所說.","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]下依教理成立有空則有菩提.","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"解脫心無著　煩惱得消滅　煩惱業消除　斯由解脫力.","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"愛取不相緣　以此無執持　愛業而羸劣　是無有癡愛.","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"受愛得相緣　此受而有得　安住有著心　是得名處處.","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若心之不空　復得名爲著　心性若雲空　如識而無得.","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]如應正等覺　所說之妙法　是義乃大乘　大乘行平等.","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"說法之一時　了一切過患　一味之平等　諸佛無不說.","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"迦葉大尊者　如言之不知　彼汝雲不覺　不受當何作.","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"解脫力若怖　輪迴得成就　迷彼苦空事　而得於此果.","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"迷空彼若此　不得謗於法　此空審觀察　是故得不疑。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]離[三]暗知煩惱　因法知於空　欲速一切知　彼言審觀察.","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]若物生於苦　是苦怖得生　彼苦因空[五]作　彼何得生怖.","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若於彼物怖　斯卽名我[六]所　如是我無所　苦怖雲何得。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下二頌仍辨大乘是佛說.初頌意謂大小乘教相有無相同應俱是佛說.次頌意謂聲聞不明此理亦不成非佛說.","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]庚五以觀空爲佛道故勸修.又三.今辛初以空爲二障對治勸修.","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]二本意謂所知障煩惱障.","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]此下斷除初業者於空恐怖.","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[五]據二本當作滅.","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[六]據二本此字衍文.次句同.","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]牙齒髮爪甲　骨肉幷血髓　鼻洟唾膿涎　脂肪及腸胃.","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"便痢汗熱風　九漏幷六識.","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是諸法等　一切皆無我.","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]說彼智與聲　聲恆受一切　若說聲智離　彼離雲何知.","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若智之不知　彼智難知故　彼智旣決定　乃近於智智.","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"此智非聲受　彼聲何以聞　彼聲近於心　彼知色如是.","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若受於色聲　而色復何受　如彼一父子　思惟無真實.","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]有情塵所翳　無父亦無子　知聲色如是　亦無於自性.","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼色如是知　喻樂暫和合　彼自性如是　彼一而言有.","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"餘色鹹不實　此說色下品　彼一切智心　煩惱悉清淨.","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"思惟一覺心　彼等彼若無　愛若虛不實　雲何住於見.","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]無我而無心　此心喻畫像　是心智相應　清淨愚癡破.","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]辛次明空能對治爲怖畏因之我執.又二.今壬初依遮止人我執門明空.","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]下破數論宗我執.","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]勘二本此句謂喜憂闇三德.","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]下破正理宗我執.","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是之自心　彼作雲何作　彼愚癡無行　此我而虛作.","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]有行自出離　而無惡業果　破壞業若爲　善果雲何得.","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"此二之行果　互相破成就　彼說知不虛　彼自而無事.","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因果定相應　惡見要不生　此行而實住　作受今當說.","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"過去未來心　彼我無有生　此心生我破　我無復生起.","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如芭蕉作柱　無所能勝任　我心生亦然　是得善觀察.","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有情若不有　此[二]行雲何爲　彼行今若爲　而爲有癡事.","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有情何實無　癡喻其愛事　若滅於苦惱　當斷於癡事.","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"我慢爲苦因　癡是得增長　彼事心不迴　觀空爲最上。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]無足無脛膝　無腰復無腿　無臂亦無肩　無臍無胸背.","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無肋兼無脅　無手亦無鼻　無項復無頭　骨鎖等皆爾.","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"觀此一切身　不行於一處　彼行於處處　何處自安住.","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下斷無我應因果不屬大悲不成難.","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]據二本當作悲.次句同.","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]壬後依四念處遮止法我執門明空.初身念處.分辨有分身不實各分不實.及於身貪著非理.","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以彼身手等　一切處皆住　彼一身如是　乃至於手等.","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無內無外身　何獨身手等　手等無分別　雲何彼復有.","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼旣無癡身　寧雲意手等　住已近殊勝　觀者知人喻.","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若彼因和合　木人此可同　若了如是相　彼身同此見.","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是捨足指　手指亦皆捨　彼初觀節合　後見節自離.","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"此身破已竟　彼住分別見　分別見此身　得喻如虛空.","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是之夢色　智者何所樂　設施若無身　何有男女等.","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]若喜真得苦　此者何不解　觀察此雲何　愛樂深煩惱.","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"樂者之不實　如彼無執受　汝苦復雲何　如彼自無得.","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼有苦微細　旣微而不說　以彼微細故　不說令他喜.","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因瞋而苦生　旣生而有滅　若於定有見　於生自不受.","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是而旣知　如是觀因果　禪愛或相應　得生彼疑地.","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下受念處.就受自性.因觸.受境.有境.自相等門.明受非實有二本初半頌意雲.苦若實在.應無喜等.","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"善根之所利　皆爲於何人　彼此何和合　和合而何得.","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"人喻於虛空　雖合而無入　無入而非合　是無分別行.","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"不求和合名　若見而無見　和合彼不求　雲何名得生.","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有物非和合　如導而先知　而彼識無相　不住於和合.","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼觸法如是　何受而得生　我今何所爲　而得於苦害.","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若不得所受　若害而不覺　此位彼得見　何愛不遠離.","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"今見此夢觸　自心之幻化　旣見彼觸性　彼受汝亦得.","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"先世與後世　念念而無受　若此觀自身　受亦無所得.","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"所受旣不實　彼卽知無有　若此無自身　雲何如是害.","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]色性之自住　無根無中閒　無內無外色　別處亦不得.","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"身若無異處　無合無分別　有情之自性　寂靜彼無所.","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"智者若先知　雲何而有著　智者同智故　彼生何得著.","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下心念處.明意無自性.根識亦無自性.二本初頌意謂意不住根色及中間.","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"是智是後得　是智雲何得.　[一]如是一切法　雖生而無得.","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如是法若無　是[二]法雲何二　彼餘法若是　有情皆寂靜.","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼他心有疑　於自卽無有　彼定彼後有　此法無彼此.","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]思惟於自心　是二互相住　如得於正住　一切智者說.","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若有諸智者　獲得於智智　智者得是智　彼卽是無位.","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"智者得是智　有得而無住　無住卽無生　彼說於涅槃.","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若彼之二法　如是極難住　若法由於智　智者何因有.","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"是智由於知　知者無所得　二法互相由　是有情無性.","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無父定無子　欲子生何得　有父而有子　彼二法亦爾.","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"芽從種子生　種子得何求　知從智所生　彼實何不行.","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"芽從智種生　知從智芽有　若彼知不知　何得有智智.","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]一切人因緣　彼前皆已說　因果所生起　等喻如蓮華.","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下法念處.廣辨勝義諦中一切法無生滅.兼破異宗邪執.初解無生滅則應無世俗不成二諦難.又離俗諦衆生應無涅槃難.","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]據二本當作諦.","sortOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]次解無生滅雲何成所知難.","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]以下廣破異宗邪執.先遮無因而生.","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因果何由作　皆從於過去　此果雲何得　由過去業力.","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]世閒因自在　自在彼何說　如是得後有　彼彼名何雜.","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"是事唯不定　非心非賢聖　過惡無善報　彼何得自在.","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"不見如虛空　不見自過去　自在不思議　此理不應說.","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼主何最上　彼亦自無定　善惡各自性　智者知無邊.","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"因業有苦樂　彼說何等作　先因若不有　果報誰雲得.","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"雲何不作恆　彼無於別見　彼作旣無別　何得見彼彼.","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若見和合因　無復雲自在　此和合無主　彼法乃無主.","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼愛不自愛　此愛而無作　所得而由他　何雲自在作.","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]彼不作過去　謂若恆不滅.　[三]愛此最上數　謂世閒恆常.","sortOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有情塵暗蔽　住此惡功德　謂此說最上　此說世閒惡.","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"一三之自性　不合而無有　是德無所有　彼各各三種.","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]次遮由自在常法而生.","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]次遮由極微常法而生.二本此半頌意雲.若謂極微常.是等已論破.","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]次遮由最勝等常法生.二本此半頌意雲.又數論者說.自性常爲因.","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"功德雖無聲　此聲有還遠　如衣等無心　由此生快樂.","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"色性之亦然　觀之性無有　彼等快樂因　有無若衣等.","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"此衣等快樂　此乃性快樂　彼等之快樂　不能得久遠.","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼得是微細　雲何彼麤細　快樂如是實　思惟何不受.","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"離麤得微細　微細不久遠　一切物亦然　久遠何不得.","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"快樂得不麤　快樂不常定　彼無有所生　此說不真實.","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼真實德生　彼得無欲住　爲食不淨食　而有於因果.","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"愛無價之衣　買覩羅種子　不愛世閒癡　彼住真如智.","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼智世閒有　雲何而不見　同彼世閒量　若此分明見.","sortOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"世量而非量　彼無妄言說　是故觀真如　彼空而不生.","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"知性之不觸　是性而無執　彼性實非實　是故非實性.","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"是故彼夢覺　此疑彼無有　彼性若見有　乃不實生著.","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]是故知彼性　無因卽無所　一切皆無主　因緣中安住.","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]由彼無別異　不住復不去　於實彼若迷　返爲世閒勝.","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"爲從因所生　爲從幻化作　何來彼何去　了知而若此.","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若此而了知　乃見彼無性　雲何知假實　同於影像等.","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]性若雲自有　是因何所立　彼若是不有　彼因故不用.","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有無之性相　因俱胝百千　彼位雲何性　何得於別性.","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼性無性時　是性何時得　無性卽無生　當依彼性行.","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"性無過去性　而由性不生　無有性無性　喻幻化和合.","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"一切有無性　有如是不滅　此一切世閒　是故不生滅.","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"知行空不實　喻夢喻芭蕉　分別滅不滅　一切不可得。","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]性空乃如是　何得而何受　不實恆若斯　彼彼雲何得.","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"何苦何快樂　何愛何不愛　彼愛何所愛　要當知自性.","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]以下總結.二本此頌意雲.依如是决定.物無無因者.然各別和合.因緣中不住.","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]次遮緣起故常執.","sortOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]次遮有因故實執.","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]辛三於昧空生苦者修悲.","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"世閒亦可知　何名爲無上　何人何所親　何生而何得.","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"一切喻虛空　彼此受皆失　歡喜瞋相對　因喜或鬬諍.","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"瞋惱諸邪行　一切令破壞　罪惡自愛樂　是得惡趣名.","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"死卽墮惡趣　得苦而無悔　或往來天中　生生而得樂.","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"捨於多罪崖　謂真實如是　如是真無性　復互相憎愛.","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"說彼將來惡　溺無邊苦海　色力幷夀命　彼得而唯少.","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"雖獲於快樂　而由飢困者　眠睡災昏迷　如虛幻和合.","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"當盡彼虛幻　若此而難得　彼學何所作　何行何斷除.","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼彼諸魔事　斯爲大罪崖　於彼多正道　難勝而不行.","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"復於刹那中　難得生覺悟　過去未來苦　難竭煩惱海.","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"而於此苦海　我恨苦求離　如是此安住　若自不樂住.","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如須臾須臾　入火而澡浴　見如是自利　而受於此苦.","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無老死自在　彼行因如是　從彼惡法來　感惡而前死.","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"苦火熱如是　我何時得息　自作於快樂　福雲生繚繞.","sortOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]以我何見知　而說知慧空　稽首具足知　稽首福德重。","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]菩提心迴向品第八","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]菩提行若此思惟於行福　菩提行莊嚴　一切人皆得.","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"乃至一切處　身心苦惱者　彼得此妙福　歡喜快樂海.","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若有不自在　而處輪迴者　使得世閒樂　及得菩提樂.","sortOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若有世界中　乃至於地獄　而令彼等人　悉受極快樂.","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"寒苦得溫暖　熱苦得清涼　菩薩大雲覆　復浴法水海.","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"鐵樹鐵山峯　劍林光閃爍　一切成劫樹　罪人喜安樂.","sortOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"喻迦那摩迦囉拏　鴛鴦鵝鴈聲適悅　池沼清淨無濁穢　微妙諸香生喜樂.","sortOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"地獄爐炭聚　而得摩尼聚　熱地水精嚴　復寶山和合","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本此頌結上.意雲.尊無所得相.以積福資糧.有得成藴者.應教以空性.","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]二本迴向品第十.","sortOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]科段.大文甲後明入已.究竟迴向.又四.乙初爲他有情迴向.又二.今丙初明世間迴向.初三頌總標.意謂我已述入菩提行.願以此善使諸趣皆得入.十方一切身心有苦痛者.以我此福使入安樂海.以下分就三惡道人天以明迴向.","sortOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以如是供養　善逝宮皆滿.","sortOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"炭火熱劍雨　今後灑華雨　彼劍互相殺　今後華互散.","sortOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"爛搗諸身肉　喻君那華色　肉骨與火同　棄墮柰河水","sortOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以我善力故　令得天宮殿.","sortOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼光如千日　彼滿那枳你　焰魔之獄卒　見者不驚怖","sortOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"烏鷲等飛類　悉離惡食苦　愛彼普快樂　此得何善生","sortOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"福喻於虛空　觀此上下等　如見金剛手　速滅除災患.","sortOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"降彼華香雨　破滅地獄火　雲何名快樂　雲何名歡喜","sortOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"處彼地獄者　得見觀自在.","sortOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"同一切威德　俱胝髻童子　大悲菩提心　救度於一切.","sortOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以彼天供養　天冠及天華　乃至悲心華　適悅寶樓閣","sortOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"天女之言說　百千種歌詠　讚大聖文殊　及普賢菩薩.","sortOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"以此善功德　同於地獄者.","sortOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]大聖觀自在　觀察地獄苦　無量苦可怖　手出甘露乳.","sortOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"濟彼諸餓鬼　與食與洗浴　令飽滿清涼　離苦得快樂.","sortOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如彼北洲人　色力幷夀命.","sortOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"聾者得聞聲　盲者得見色　妊娠及產生　喻摩耶無苦.","sortOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"雖衣雖飲食　莊嚴而清淨　一切隨求意　得利復得益.","sortOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"怖者不受怖　不樂而得樂　煩惱得無惱　見者皆歡喜.","sortOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"病者獲安樂　解脫一切縛.","sortOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_287","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無力而得力　愛心互相施.","sortOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"安樂於十方　行道一切至　惡事皆滅盡　當成就好事.","sortOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_289","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"乘船商賈人　得滿所求意　安樂到彼岸　親等同嬉戲.","sortOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_290","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"旣饉時路行　得伴無所畏　不怖賊與[二]虎.","sortOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_292","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本此下三頌文義不次.略謂使地獄苦滅.使惡趣難除.使離獸噬怖.使同北洲樂.觀自在手乳.浴鬼常清涼.","sortOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_293","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]據二本此下應有句雲.不疲安然過.","sortOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_295","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"復不怖迷醉　曠野無病難　耄幼無主宰　賢聖悉加護.","sortOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_296","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"諸煩惱解脫　悲愍信智慧　具足相修行　恆得宿命通.","sortOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_297","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"而得無盡藏　乃至虛空藏　無緣無方便　無少才不喜.","sortOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_298","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"有情乏名聞　當得大名稱　出家若醜陋　當得具色相.","sortOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_299","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若彼有三界　使彼得丈夫　亦離高下品　當破我慢意.","sortOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_300","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"今我一切福　利[一]諸有情等　常離一切罪　恆作善利事.","sortOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_301","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"菩提心所行　菩提行不退　遠離我慢業　當得佛受記.","sortOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_302","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"一切有情等　得無量夀命　夀命得恆長　破壞無常聲.","sortOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_303","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"劫樹苑適悅　一切方皆得　妙法而適意　同佛佛圓滿.","sortOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_304","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼諸高下石　如掌而平坦　柔輭琉璃色　一切地皆得.","sortOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_305","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"諸大菩薩衆　普徧諸國土　以自住光明　莊嚴於大地.","sortOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_306","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"諸樹及飛禽　光明於虛空　說法聲不住　諸有情常聞.","sortOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_308","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本此句意雲.利所餘諸趣.乃就上文所未述及者言之.","sortOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_310","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"佛及佛子等　彼彼恆得見　無邊供養雲　供養於世尊.","sortOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_311","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"天雨依時節　穀麥鹹豐實　世閒得具足　王法得依行.","sortOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_312","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"藥力倍增盛　明力皆成就　羅刹拏吉儞　斯等皆悲愍.","sortOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_313","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無有苦有情　無罪復無病.[一]不輕慢下劣　煩惱無所得","sortOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_314","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"讀誦而自在　隨意而行住.","sortOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_315","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"衆集乃恆常　成就於僧事　苾芻住淨戒　復得一切解.","sortOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_316","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"觀察於心業　捨離諸煩惱　苾芻所得利　當遠離鬬諍.","sortOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_317","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"諸出家亦然　不得破禁戒　得戒而守護　恆樂盡諸罪.","sortOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_318","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若彼不破戒　得益往天趣　若彼持鉢者　爲得於善利.","sortOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_319","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"得清淨種子　名聞滿諸方　永不受罪苦　恆行無苦處.","sortOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_320","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"無邊諸有情　供養一切佛　當受一天身　彼成佛世閒.","sortOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_321","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"不思議有情　樂佛而得樂。[二]願爲於世閒　菩薩得成就.","sortOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_323","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]下明使入正法.","sortOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_324","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]丙後明出世迴向.","sortOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_326","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼尊若思惟　彼有情令得　辟支佛安樂　及得聲聞樂","sortOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_327","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]天人阿修羅　意重而恆護。","sortOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_328","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]若彼宿命通　出家此恆得　若彼歡喜地　文殊師利住.","sortOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_329","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"我若以彼位　隨力而能與　若知和合住　得生於一切.","sortOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_330","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"若有欲見者　及有欲聞者　如是彼得見　文殊師利尊.","sortOrder":330},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_331","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"如日照十方　爲一切有情　彼文殊修行　我得如是行.","sortOrder":331},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_332","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"彼或住虛空　或住於世閒　今我住亦然　得壞世閒苦.","sortOrder":332},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_333","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"世閒若有苦　彼一切我得　世閒一切善　菩薩之樂得。","sortOrder":333},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_334","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]一藥救世閒　一切皆富樂　一切同利養　佛教而久住。","sortOrder":334},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_335","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]以善意清淨　歸命於文殊　我說善知識　清淨此增長。","sortOrder":335},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_336","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"菩提行經卷第四","sortOrder":336},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_338","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[一]二本缺此半頌.因文段但言出世也.","sortOrder":338},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_339","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[二]乙次爲自己迴向.意謂願我以文殊加被得生初地雲雲.","sortOrder":339},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_340","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[三]乙三總教迴向.意謂正教爲唯一良藥.應常依彼.","sortOrder":340},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_338_341","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_338","text":"[四]乙四明感恩歸依.意謂依彼恩而生善意.故禮文殊.又依彼恩而增功德.故禮拜善知識.","sortOrder":341}],"overrides":{}}